---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Legal
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="What ismailoyeleke.com collects, why, how long it is kept, and the rights you have under the Nigeria Data Protection Act 2023 and the GDPR."
  updated="6 October 2026"
>
  <p>
    This site is a personal portfolio run by {site.name} from {site.locality}, {site.country}. This
    policy explains what it collects, why, and what you can ask me to do about it. It is written
    against the Nigeria Data Protection Act 2023, and I apply the same standard to visitors in the
    United Kingdom and the European Union under the UK GDPR and the GDPR.
  </p>

  <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
  <p>
    I am the data controller for this site. You can reach me at{' '}
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or on {site.phoneDisplay}. My postal location
    is {site.locality}, {site.region}, {site.country}; a full address is available on request for
    any formal data request.
  </p>

  <h2>What the site collects</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Nothing by default.</strong> Visiting a page sets no cookie and stores nothing about
      you until you choose otherwise.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Contact form.</strong> If you send a message, I receive the name, email address,
      organisation and message you typed, plus the topic you selected. This is delivered to my
      email inbox through Web3Forms, which processes it on my behalf and does not use it for its own
      purposes. The lawful basis is your consent, given by sending the message, and my legitimate
      interest in replying to enquiries.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Analytics, only if you accept.</strong> If you press Accept on the cookie banner, the
      site loads Google Analytics, which sets cookies to count visits and tell me which pages are
      read. IP addresses are anonymised. The lawful basis is your consent, and you can withdraw it
      at any time using the cookie settings link in the footer.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Hosting logs.</strong> The site is served from Amazon Web Services. Standard access
      logs, including IP address and user agent, may be recorded for security and reliability. The
      lawful basis is my legitimate interest in keeping the site running and secure.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Cookies and local storage</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      One entry in your browser's local storage records whether you accepted or declined analytics,
      so you are not asked on every page. It contains no personal data.
    </li>
    <li>
      If you accept, Google Analytics sets its own cookies. Declining sets none, and the analytics
      script is never loaded.
    </li>
    <li>
      Pressing play on an embedded video loads it from youtube-nocookie.com, at which point YouTube
      may set cookies. Nothing is requested from YouTube until you press play.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Who else processes your data</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Amazon Web Services, for hosting and content delivery.</li>
    <li>Web3Forms, for delivering contact form messages to my inbox.</li>
    <li>Google, for analytics, only after you accept.</li>
    <li>Google, for Gmail, which holds the email I receive from you.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Some of these providers are outside Nigeria, so your data may be transferred internationally.
    They operate under standard contractual clauses and their own published safeguards.
  </p>

  <h2>How long anything is kept</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Contact messages stay in my email for as long as the conversation is relevant, and no longer than three years.</li>
    <li>Analytics data is retained for 14 months and then deleted automatically.</li>
    <li>Your cookie choice stays in your browser until you clear it or change it.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask me to show you what I hold about you, correct it, delete it, restrict what I do with
    it, or send you a copy. You can object to processing based on legitimate interest, and withdraw
    consent for analytics whenever you like. Email{' '}
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> and I will respond within 30 days. If you are
    not satisfied, you can complain to the Nigeria Data Protection Commission, or to your own data
    protection authority if you are in the UK or the EU.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>
    This site is aimed at recruiters, employers and clients. It is not intended for children, and I
    do not knowingly collect data from anyone under 18.
  </p>

  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>
    The site is served over HTTPS only. It is a static site, so there is no database and no account
    to compromise. Messages reach me through an encrypted connection.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    If this policy changes, the date at the top changes with it. Material changes will be noted on
    this page.
  </p>
</Legal>
